    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "How I Spend Sunday Afternoons"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "On some Sunday afternoons, my friends and I visit each other’s homes, and we either go out to eat or"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "just visit."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "If we don’t visit with our friends, we usually go to either my family’s or my wife’s family’s house and spend time with them."
    },
